units si
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style sphere
newton off
processors 1 1 1
read_data particles.data
comm_modify vel yes
neighbor 1e-6 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
pair_style zero 6e-6
pair_coeff * *
fix integrate all nve/sphere
timestep 9.9999999999999995e-07
thermo 20
thermo_style custom step atoms time ke
thermo_modify lost error norm no format float %.17g
run 0
write_dump all custom initial.dump id type diameter radius mass x y z xu yu zu vx vy vz omegax omegay omegaz fx fy fz proc ix iy iz modify sort id format float %.17g
run 200
write_dump all custom final.dump id type diameter radius mass x y z xu yu zu vx vy vz omegax omegay omegaz fx fy fz proc ix iy iz modify sort id format float %.17g
print "ENGINE_CASE_COMPLETED"
